Package: dev.duti.locspoofgps
Name: LocSpoof GPS Filter
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Companion of Location Spoofer (experimental). While spoofing is on, location fixes that do not come from Wi-Fi (GPS, cell) are replaced with the spoofed coordinate, so satellite signal near windows can't pull the position back.
Maintainer: aitorortega00-dot
Author: aitorortega00-dot
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
